plasma. When used in this way, the Energy Lance functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbine","referenceId":"reference:76b5919337653c76"}," with no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," setting. This use of the Energy Lance requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},", and has the same ammunition capacity as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbine","referenceId":"reference:76b5919337653c76"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Energy Lance requires two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cells"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cells"}," to operate. Its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," and its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," both function unimpeded underwater.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing and Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n